{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57576","headline":"抱朴子口诀 · 无名氏","name":"抱朴子口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱砂水银入华池，收得黄芽人不知。\n本是仙人留口诀，世上喧喧乱言说。\n七十年中付一人，分付还须有仙骨。\n一一事须手眼传，采取只在片时间。\n河专覆在丹田里，制伏只在黄芽边。\n（按：抱朴子即晋葛洪。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}